Acts 18:1 , Paul labours with his hands, and preaches at Corinth to the Gentiles;
Acts 18:9 , The Lord encourages him in a vision;
Acts 18:12 , He is accused before Gallio the deputy, but is dismissed;
Acts 18:18 , Afterwards passing from city to city, he strengthens the disciples;
Acts 18:24 , Apollos, being more perfectly instructed by Aquila and Priscilla, preaches Christ with great efficacy.
